-- WebSocket client. Connects to the chat server, sends a few messages,
-- receives the broadcast echoes back, then closes.
ws is open websocket to "ws://127.0.0.1:3004/chat"

send "hello chat" to ws
echo1 is receive from ws
display "got: " + echo1

send "another message" to ws
echo2 is receive from ws
display "got: " + echo2

close websocket ws
display "done."
